<div class="display-inline-block"><button type="button" class="cursor-pointer text-no-underline bg-transparent border-0 padding-0 text-left margin-0 text-normal text-primary" aria-controls="journal_context_menu">J Cogn Eng Decis Mak</button></div>. Author manuscript; available in PMC: 2023 Dec 1.</div>
