<em>Published in final edited form as: </em>J Cogn Eng Decis Mak. 2022 May 11;16(4):194–206. doi: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1177/15553434221097357" class="usa-link usa-link--external" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">10.1177/15553434221097357</a>
</div>
<nav id="journal_context_menu" hidden="hidden"><ul class="menu-list font-family-ui" role="menu">
